# Clock (kiosk)

Public time clock under `(auth)`. Mirror **`src/features/attendance/`** + `/clock`. Do not wrap with AppShell or list-table shells.

## Rules

- Keep `/clock` middleware-public; punches still need session from on-page login
- Hook → stateless `ClockPage`; hand-rolled login form is an allowed kiosk exception (still `run()` + auth actions)
- `confirm` / `notify` for punch edge cases; `logActivity` on check-in/out
- No `TablePageViewport`, no forcing `DynamicForm` for kiosk login
- Clear local state on logout for the next employee

See `.docs/components/clock-pages.md`.
